#: processes/complete-initialization.bpmn:65
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "THE PRIMARY STEP of initializing a Knowledge Graph harness and so the first one checked once the declarations are read. Every JSON Schema the harness publishes (its `$id`) and every JSON-LD document (its vocabulary, its diagram vocabulary, its graph export, each carrying its own `@context`) is at the address it names under `iriBase`, where a program following the IRI finds it. Two checks: that the site build stages each one at its address, and that each address answers. A 404 is not published; a 403 or no answer from here could not be determined. The Pages site is the vehicle: when the documents are not yet answering, the site steps below are how they get there, and the report leads with this step's state."
msgstr ""

